{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_018_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "fa9b2426b1de5dba2709f744c569bf39c05f74cf003e8ba2c7a03724d79a2d32", "ja": "ねえねえ、歩！　しつもーんっ！\nさっきのダンスレッスンで、\nカッコイイポーズしてたでしょ！？", "zh": "欸欸，步！我有问题！\n刚才上舞蹈课的时候，\n你不是有摆一个很帅的姿势吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_018_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "bff03216b3b0bbfbeda0ff5350c7bd817bddcf317721ac8ae14679195aa8544d", "ja": "片手で体支えて、ビシッと足\n伸ばしてキメるやつ！　あれって\nどうやるの？　お願いっ、教えて！", "zh": "用一只手支撑身体，\n然后把脚伸长的帅气姿势！\n那个要怎么做啊？拜托你教教我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_018_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "393f09987a66c9b3df917c157b1be349e49cc71ec5585da26299665a8c3fdd9f", "ja": "あ、いいな～いいな～、\nたまきもやりたい！\nあゆむ、たまきにも教えて！", "zh": "啊，好棒喔～好棒喔～\n环也想学！\n步，你也教教环吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_018_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "61cc84a6b657abbf31662d7bd9ef188c95da4a6752182cbbc4b4c70114290bb5", "ja": "オッケー、構わないよ！\nあれにはコツがあって、\n思い切りのよさが大事なんだ！", "zh": "OK，没有问题！\n做那个姿势有个诀窍，\n就是要快狠准！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_018_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "f835dfdfce620f8b31b01320cea7388645ffa0d8e39d6313525605788f9b32b1", "ja": "うんうん！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
